---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
// Title "Paper Trail" is a provisional working title. Nadine hasn't named this piece yet.
// The second of two installations built for Cucalorus 2021, alongside #0000FF Velvet
// (/work/velvet). Stills only for now, following the same precedent as the other pages.
---

<BaseLayout title="Paper Trail" description="Rice-paper forms hung overhead, each catching a projected fragment of a detective film. Footsteps, not voice, drove the visuals. Cucalorus Film Festival, 2021.">
  <article class="project">

    <header class="project-header">
      <span class="eyebrow">installation · 2021</span>
      <h1 class="display-xl project-title">Paper Trail</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="hero-image">
      <img
        src="/images/velvet/8613B089-99ED-43F3-A72E-4778BBA2A50C.jpg"
        alt="Dozens of rice-paper forms hung on wire under a chicken-wire canopy, catching projected color at night"
        class="hero-img"
        onerror="this.style.display='none'"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="project-body">

      <p class="lead">
        Overhead, a second Cucalorus installation answered #0000FF Velvet in a different material: dozens of rice-paper forms, hand-cut and hung on wire beneath a canopy of chicken wire, each catching a projected fragment of a detective film. Visitors walked underneath rather than stepped inside; their footsteps drove the visuals, breaking a scene into pieces and reassembling it as they moved.
      </p>

      <div class="image-pair">
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/velvet/762AE461-32C8-4926-97F3-725645EE5864.jpg"
            alt="Rice-paper forms catching abstracted color fragments, hung on wire beneath the canopy"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="project-image">
          <img
            src="/images/velvet/IMG_0104.jpg"
            alt="A rice-paper form catching a recognizable frame from the detective film footage"
            class="content-img"
            onerror="this.style.display='none'"
          />
        </div>
      </div>

      <p>
        Where Velvet was a room to sit inside, this piece was a path to walk under: the same footage, the same night, read through the body instead of held still around it.
      </p>

    </div>

    <div class="project-meta">
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">year</span>
        <span class="meta-value">2021</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">medium</span>
        <span class="meta-value">installation: rice paper, projection mapping, footstep-reactive audio</span>
      </div>
      <div class="meta-row">
        <span class="meta-label eyebrow">venue</span>
        <span class="meta-value">Cucalorus Film Festival, Wilmington NC · 2021</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .project {
    max-width: var(--content-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-6) var(--page-padding-x) var(--space-8);
  }

  .project-header {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-5);
  }
  .project-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }

  .hero-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    min-height: 340px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .project-body {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
  }
  .lead {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-md);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }
  p {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
    color: var(--mid);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
  }

  .project-image {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .content-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
  }

  .image-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    margin: var(--space-4) 0;
  }
  .image-pair .project-image {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .project-meta {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: var(--space-4);
  }
  .meta-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    padding: var(--space-2) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .meta-label {
    color: var(--gold);
    align-self: start;
    padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .meta-value {
    font-weight: var(--w-light);
    color: var(--mid);
    line-height: var(--lh-body);
  }

  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .project {
      padding: var(--space-5) var(--page-padding-x-sm) var(--space-7);
    }
    .image-pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .meta-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
